invalid type: string "Access Permissions \n\u{f0b7} \nApply granular restrictions to \nspecific interfaces, such as \nlocking down sensitive \nintegration setup tabs. \nProfile Management \n\u{f0b7} \nModify user metadata, trigger \nadministrative password \nresets, and offboard \nmembers by removing \naccounts. \n \n====================================================================== \n== \nn\n